  "notes": "USAGE: {回復|かいふく} is used for various types of recovery - from illness, economic downturns, or returning to a previous state.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {回復|かいふく}する (to recover, to recuperate)\n- {回復|かいふく}に{向|む}かう (to be on the path to recovery)\n- ⟦{早期|そうき}→早期：09568_souki⟧{回復|かいふく} (early/quick recovery)\n- ⟦{完全|かんぜん}→完全：01552_kanzen⟧{回復|かいふく} (full recovery)\n- ⟦{景気|けいき}→景気：02694_keiki⟧{回復|かいふく} (economic recovery)\n- ⟦{体力|たいりょく}→体力：05318_tairyoku⟧の{回復|かいふく} (physical recovery)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {回復|かいふく} - recovery (general, returning to normal)\n- ⟦{復旧|ふっきゅう}→復旧：07521_fukkyuu⟧ - restoration (infrastructure, systems)\n- ⟦{復活|ふっかつ}→復活：12565_fukkatsu⟧ - revival, comeback",
